<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#142238"><title>Report a found item | Sherubtse Lost &amp; Found</title><link rel="icon" href="/Sherubtse_logo/images.jpg"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><script src="/js/app.js" defer></script></head><body><%- include('partials/navbar') %><main class="page-main form-page"><section class="form-intro"><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Found item report</span><h1>Help return something to its owner.</h1><p>Share where and when you found it. Keep one distinctive detail private so the owner can confirm it.</p></section><form id="item-form" class="report-panel"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="found"><div class="form-two"><label>Item name<input name="title" maxlength="120" placeholder="e.g. Black umbrella" required></label><label>Category<select name="category" required><option value="">Choose a category</option><option>Electronics</option><option>ID cards &amp; wallets</option><option>Bags</option><option>Books &amp; notes</option><option>Keys</option><option>Clothing</option><option>Sports equipment</option><option>Other</option></select></label></div><label>Description<textarea name="description" required rows="4" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Colour, brand, visible details"></textarea></label><div class="form-two"><label>Found at<input name="location" maxlength="120" placeholder="e.g. Library, Academic Block" required></label><div class="date-field"><label for="found-date-display">Date found</label><div class="date-control" data-date-format="dmy"><input id="found-date-display" data-date-display type="text" placeholder="DD/MM/YYYY" maxlength="10" pattern="[0-9]{2}/[0-9]{2}/[0-9]{4}" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="found-date-help" required><span class="date-picker-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M16 3v4M8 3v4M3 11h18"/></svg></span><input id="found-date-picker" name="itemDate" class="date-native" type="date" aria-label="Choose date found from calendar"></div><small id="found-date-help">DD/MM/YYYY &middot; Type a date or use the calendar.</small></div></div><label class="file-field">Add a photo (optional)<input name="photo" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"><small>JPG, PNG, or WebP, up to 30 MB.</small></label><label class="check-line"><input name="phonePublic" type="checkbox" required><span>I understand that my phone number will be shown publicly on this listing (required).</span></label><p class="form-notice">Your name and course are shown with the listing. Phone sharing is required for new posts. Your registered phone number will be visible to anyone browsing this listing. Your college email is visible to signed-in students.</p><button class="button button-navy" type="submit">Post found item <span>→</span></button><p class="form-message" id="form-message" role="status"></p></form></main><%- include('partials/footer') %></body></html>
